WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.859
There's a powerful David versus

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.359
Goliath lesson emerging from

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.549
Russia's brazen, unprovoked invasion

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.509
of Ukraine.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.919
That should give deep pause to

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.659
global superpowers who think they

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.459
can simply muscle the world into

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.839
whatever shape they want.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.639
Every Russian tank that gets fried

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.709
in Ukraine is sending the message

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.599
that traditional armies can no

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.669
longer expect to dominate simply

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.839
because they have more troops,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.129
weapons and money.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.929
Russian armored vehicles are falling

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.969
victim to next generation light

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.970
anti-tank weapons, NLAWS,

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.109
which can be carried by individual

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.539
soldiers unslung in seconds

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.763
and deployed with little training

00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:37.079
but deadly accuracy.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.459
There are credible reports that

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.379
Russia has already lost $5

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.299
billion worth of military equipment

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.799
in just a month of fighting in

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.599
Ukraine. That's the reality of

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.159
contemporary warfare.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.959
Smaller, nimbler groups fighting

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.419
back effectively against lumbering

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.279
dumb relics of the past.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.929
Despite being the fifth largest

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.519
fighting force on the planet and

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.409
starting the war with five times

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.879
the number of active military as

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.009
Ukraine, Russia has been stymied

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.629
in what virtually all observers

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.249
expected to be a cakewalk.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.139
The human cost for Russia is

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.639
even more staggering.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.529
Nearly 10,000 soldiers killed

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.419
in action, including at least five

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.319
generals.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.299
Which isn't to say that Russia

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.279
isn't also inflicting massive,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.079
horrific violence against Ukraine,

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.429
or that it won't prevail in this

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.319
conflict, especially the longer

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.279
things drag on.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.229
But this war underscores what James

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:26.819
Dale Davidson and Lord William

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.859
Rees-Mogg called the changing logic

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.539
of violence and the diminishing

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.249
returns to violence in their

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.319
prophetic 1997 book

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.059
The Sovereign Individual.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.709
As weapons have become smaller,

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:39.479
cheaper, more effective and more

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.739
widely dispersed.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.749
It's harder and harder for old style

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.459
militaries to quickly and

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:46.619
effectively achieve their objectives

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.659
through brute force as they meet

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:51.329
resistance at every turn.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.189
That resistance includes information

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.139
warfare such as hacking and cyber

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.969
attacks, but also the use of

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:58.619
social media, which Ukraine's

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.869
President Zelensky has excelled at

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.239
to project an aura of invincibility

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.279
and to cast the conflict in stark

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.079
terms of good versus evil.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.879
This lesson shouldn't be new to

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.829
Americans, as our failures over

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.839
the past two decades in Afghanistan

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.179
and Iraq underscored the new reality

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.469
that old school invasion and

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.389
occupation is more expensive

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.339
and temporary than it is quick

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.239
and effective.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.829
But Russia's incompetence drives

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.839
home in graphic detail to us,

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.519
and one hopes to the Chinese

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:28.229
officials supposedly eyeing an

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:29.439
invasion of Taiwan.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.439
But even if Goliath does take

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:33.449
out David, the price is too

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.909
high and the victory too transition

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.259
to bother undertaking.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.119
If the collapse of the Soviet Union,

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.949
that gargoyle incarnation

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.929
of belief in top down authority

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.609
power and decision making was the

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.169
beginning of the end of the 20th

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.909
century's romance with the nation

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.709
state than Russia's blundering in

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.839
Ukraine and the US's in Central

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.519
Asia and the Middle East may be its

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.509
epitaph.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.249
The future belongs not to the

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.899
ignorant armies of the night who

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.819
seek to command and control,

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.379
but to those who embrace it and

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.209
power the decentralization of

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.789
weapons technology, information

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.919
currency and individual

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.539
ingenuity and courage.

